              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagatsha ayisithupha aphuma ezinhlangothini zalo; izingalo ezintathu zothi lwesibani kolunye uhlangothi lwalo, nezingalo ezintathu zothi lwesibani kolunye uhlangothi lwalo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
