              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izindebe ezintathu ezenziwe ngohlobo lwama-alimondi engalweni yinye, iqhina neluba; nezindebe ezintathu ezifana nama-alimondi kwenye ingalo, iqhikiza neluba; kanjalo ngezingalo eziyisithupha eziphuma othini lwesibani.",
          "type": "text",
