              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walenza i-altare lempepho ngomuthi womtholo; ubude balo babuyingalo nobubanzi balo buyingalo; laliyisikwele; ukuphakama kwawo kwakuyizingalo ezimbili; izimpondo zakhe zazifana nayo.",
