              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walihuqa ngegolide elicwengekileyo ngaphezulu, nezinhlangothi zalo nxazonke, nezimpondo zalo; walenzela umqhele wegolide inhlangothi zonke.",
          "type": "text",
